        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-teal-deep/80 dark:text-slate-300">
          Like the butterfly emerging from its chrysalis, our mission is to facilitate the metamorphosis of vulnerability into strength. We don't just provide aid; we provide the environment for souls to take flight.
